s elevation).\n26\t- **EXECUTE â†’ gate (1026) â†’ 2 reviewers (A GO; B GO+1 MAJOR) â†’ fix iter 1 â†’ re-gate (1029) â†’ re-review GO.**\n27\t- **MAJOR fixed (the key catch):** the stale rule originally used the top-2 link_health rows by\n28\t  timestamp with no inter-probe-day gate, so the W3 activation's same-day probes would have retired\n29\t  **7 live artifacts tonight** â€” contradicting the spec's \"armed, not demonstrated (~2 weeks of probe\n30\t  history)\". Fixed: require 2 DISTINCT stale probe-days. **Independently verified on the LIVE KB\n31\t  (read-only): stale_candidates 7â†’0, cold_candidates 0, local skills 822-824 protected â€” nothing\n32\t  retires tonight.** New tests lock the masked same-day case.\n33\t- **Gate:** `python -m pytest` â†’ 1029 passed (was 1009; +20). No live retirement run. KB backups retained.\n34\t\n35\t### Wave 4 â€” The taste score â€” âœ… GREEN (2026-06-10)\n36\t\n37\t- **Status:** converged with 0 fix-iterations (both reviewers GO; only non-blocking MINORs); committed.\n38\t  Live activation done (migration applied + supervised LLM run).\n39\t- **Files:** `roles/taste.py` (new â€” `resolve_taste_model`, `score_one`, `heuristic_score`, `run` nightly\n40\t  leg + cap + degrade-to-heuristic, `ensure_scored`/`score_pending` on-demand), `kb/migrations/0025_interest_score.sql`\n41\t  (+ `kb/schema.sql` mirror: `interest_score REAL`, `interest_why TEXT`, `interest_scored_at TEXT`),\n42\t  `kb/pricing.yaml` (`default_models.taste` â†’ `claude-haiku-4-5-20251001`, already priced $1/$5 verified),\n43\t  `docs/INTEREST_PROFILE.md` (new â€” John-editable taste profile), `morning_briefing.py` (`_top_finds`\n44\t  orders by interest_score, NULL-last, W1 tiebreak; why upgrades to interest_why), `tests/test_taste.py`\n45\t  + `tests/test_pricing_keys.py` (E17 priced-tag identity).\n46\t- **Model:** `claude-haiku-4-5-20251001` â€” already priced, cheapest Anthropic tier, no new provider dep.\n47\t- **EXECUTE â†’ gate (1009) â†’ 2 reviewers